        <detaileddescription>
<para>Calculates the color based on the number of iterations.</para>
<para>This function determines the color of each pixel in the fractal by mapping the iteration count (how many steps we are needed to reach a threshold) to a color gradient.</para>
<para>For non-technical users:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>The function decides the color of each pooint in the fractal, creating the beautiful patterns you see based on how &quot;complex&quot; the point is.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
