</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of iterations required for the opint to &quot;escape&quot;. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Returns the calculated color as an integer. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
