    <briefdescription>
<para>Core calculations for fractal rendering. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file contains the functions responsible for performing the core calculations required to render fractals. It handles:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Scaling and positioning the fractal within the rendering window.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Precomputing the coordinates ffor each pixel to optimize rendering performance.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Rendering the fractal by delegating to specific algorithms (Julia or Mandelbrot).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Mapping iteration counts to colors for visually representing fractal complexity.</para>
<para>For non-technical users:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>This file performs the &quot;math magic&quot; that powers the fractal visuals, calculating where and howw the fractal is drawn and colored on the screen. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
